{"success": true, "data": {"stdout": "{"conversation_id": "benign_ta_000", "turns": [{"role": "user", "content": "Could you help me set up mobile device management for my small business? I’m looking for tools that allow me to remotely manage employee devices, enforce security policies, and monitor device usage. What are some good options, and how do I actually set them up step by step?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Absolutely! Setting up **Mobile Device Management (MDM)** is a great way to ensure security, compliance, and efficiency in your small business. MDM allows you to **remotely manage employee devices**, **enforce security policies**, and **monitor device usage**—all from a centralized platform.\n\nBelow, I’ll walk you through:\n\n1. **What MDM is and why it matters**\n2. **Top MDM tools for small businesses**\n3. **Step-by-step setup guide for one of the best tools (Microsoft Intune)**\n4. **Best practices for using MDM in a small business**\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 **What is Mobile Device Management (MDM)?**\n\nMDM is a solution that allows IT administrators to **manage and secure mobile devices** (iOS, Android, Windows) used by employees. It enables you to:\n\n- Enforce security policies (e.g., passwords, encryption)\n- Monitor device usage and app activity\n- Remotely wipe devices\n- Deploy apps and configurations\n- Restrict device access to certain apps or data\n- Track device locations\n\n---\n\n## ✅ **Top MDM Tools for Small Businesses**\n\nHere are some of the best MDM tools for small businesses, depending on your needs:\n\n| Tool | Platform | Key Features | Cost |\n|------|----------|--------------|------|\n| **Microsoft Intune** | Windows, iOS, Android | Cloud-based, integrates with Azure AD, device enrollment, app management | Free (with Azure AD) / $5–$20/user/month |\n| **Google Workspace (formerly G Suite) MDM** | Android, iOS | Easy setup, integrates with Google Workspace, device policies | Free for basic use / $5–$15/user/month |\n| **Jamf Pro**